sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Dream-RSI meta layer
  participant E as TensorNEAT (swarm/)
  participant S as sim_jax (10,000 envs)
  participant C as Classic guidance
  participant F as runs/<run>/
  participant B as brain_window
  participant K as Basilisk re-fly

  M->>M: replay logged generations → pick strategy (mutation, crossover, missions/candidate)
  M->>E: strategy for generation g
  E->>S: population genomes (brain + mission genes)
  S->>S: reset(keys) · inject failures · noisy sensors
  loop lax.scan over time (2,400 steps @ 0.1 s)
    S->>S: obs → pilot net → thrust → physics → touchdown check
  end
  C->>S: same missions, same keys (baseline)
  S-->>E: fitness (landing gate · distance · fuel · surface terms) + failure reasons
  E->>E: select · breed · mutate
  E->>F: generation_XXX.json (scores, failures, champion genome, strategy)
  E->>F: champion_XXX.json (genes + control log)
  F-->>B: poll new files → charts, swarm map, heatmap
  F-->>K: champion → Basilisk higher-fidelity check → telemetry_XXX.csv
  M->>M: add generation g to replay pool
